# Keep a readable inventory next to the visual library for future implementation work.
md=["# DESIGN SYSTEM — Stack to Six Native", "", "Visual library: design-library/typography/index.html", "", "## Working agreement", "", 'A/B comparison: click a text/marker (or mark action), press Usporedi to pin A, then explicitly choose B in another modal. Navigation alone does not select B. A focused dialog shows real crops, a shared2×font sample, large sizes/colors, differences, context and editable comparison prompt. Each entry also has Usporedi A ↔ B; optional searchable B picker and swap are available.', "", 'Navigation categories are collapsible via their headings. Backpack dice details initially shows only the first die; Vidi sve / Prikaži manje expands or reduces the remaining21links.', "", "- Read this file and the measured data before changing typography or CTA styles.", "- Display sizes use logical design px: numeric values map 1:1 to UIKit points, not physical screenshot pixels.", "- After a requested UI style change, update the Native implementation, capture the affected actual components, regenerate this document, HTML, data and portable ZIP.", "- Keep screenshots and measurements in agreement. Do not relabel old images as updated captures.", "- Navigation titles: 28 px across Journey, Arcade, Forest, Beach, Area 55, Settings and Backpack. Preserve existing font weights and colors unless asked to change them.", "- Stage stats modals across every world and Play/Continue: title 28 px ExtraBold, both numbers 28 px Bold, High score / Longest combo labels 18 px Medium. Sizes stay fixed across compact layouts.", "- Arcade mode modal titles: 28 px ExtraBold, #AD8775 across Endurance, One Lucky Drop and Slow Burn.", "- Standard body descriptions / subtitles formerly20px now18px across Exit, details, Settings, score/backpack info, tutorial and result labels. Existing weights/colors are preserved; hero/celebration text keeps its separate hierarchy.", "- Former 19 px text is standardized to 18 px: Journey world-progress counters and Arcade mode descriptions. Preserve existing font weights and colors.", "- All white secondary CTA labels use #BDA08E, Baloo2-ExtraBold28; primary ivory text and button surfaces retain their authored styling.", "- Modal titles, subtitles, hero/result headings, numeric statistics and CTA labels are separate roles; compare consistency within the same role.", "- Backpack · Kockice details has one clickable actual modal capture for every catalog die: Forest6, Beach6, Area556, Arcade4. Existing Wee Bee reference remains stable.", "- Screen examples are controlled production-component snapshots at 390 × 844 logical px; they are not player save screenshots.", "- Runtime Swift source is authoritative. This inventory represents the captured states; regenerate affected captures after changes.", "", "Documentation action: screenshot-location buttons use orange #EE8158.", "", "## Captured typography and CTA inventory", ""]
for scene in scenes:
    md += ["### "+scene['name'], "", "Route: "+scene['route'], "", "Screenshot: ["+scene['id']+"](../typography/"+scene['screenshot']+")", "", "| Reference | Element / role | Font | Size (px) | Color | CTA / control size (px) |", "|---|---|---|---:|---|---|"]
    for t in scene['texts']:
        clean=lambda v:str(v).replace('|','/').replace('\n',' / ')
        b=t.get('button');dim=(str(round(b['size']['width'],2))+" × "+str(round(b['size']['height'],2))) if b else "—"
        md.append('| '+ ' | '.join(map(clean,[t['reference'],t['text']+' · '+t['role'],t['font'],round(t['size'],2),t['colorDescription'],dim]))+' |')
    md += ["", "Source: `"+scene['source']+"`", ""]
(base/'DESIGN_SYSTEM.md').write_text(('\n'.join(md)+'\n').replace('## Captured typography and CTA inventory','## Pas — pomoćnik na stranici\n\nOtvoriti **Pitaj psa** dolje desno. Odabrani tekst/gumb postaje kontekst za usporedbu sa sličnim ulogama, prikaz razlika i označavanje rezultata. Lokalna usporedba i pretraga veličina rade odmah. Tipkanje i mikrofon služe unosu pitanja; nema čitanja odgovora. Slobodan AI razgovor uključuje se zasebno preko **Spoji AI**. Upute i granice: [ASSISTANT.md](ASSISTANT.md). Pokretanje: `python3 design-library/typography/serve.py --port 8766`.\n\n'+'## Captured typography and CTA inventory'))
